# ============================================================
#  Fix 3 (e): recepcion DENTRO de la vista del mensaje del
#  historial (espera bloqueante de A/B)
# ============================================================
wait 200
lora rx primero
wait 400
expect serial Guardado: primero
pot 512
wait 200
tap morse
wait 300
expect text Historial
lora rx alfa
lora rx bravo
in 0 morse down
in 120 morse up
run 900
expect serial Guardado: alfa
expect serial Guardado: bravo
print Fix 3: RX DENTRO de la vista del mensaje verificada
